#### Phase 1: Extension DI Infrastructure (Weeks 1-2)

1. **Create Extension Service Collection Interface**:
   ```csharp
   public interface IExtensionServiceCollection
   {
       IExtensionServiceCollection AddSingleton<TService, TImplementation>()
           where TService : class
           where TImplementation : class, TService;
       IExtensionServiceCollection AddScoped<TService, TImplementation>()
           where TService : class
           where TImplementation : class, TService;
       IExtensionServiceCollection AddTransient<TService, TImplementation>()
           where TService : class
           where TImplementation : class, TService;
   }
   ```

2. **Implement Registration Validator**:
   ```csharp
   public class ExtensionServiceValidator
   {
       private readonly ISet<Type> _reservedInterfaces;

       public ValidationResult Validate(ServiceDescriptor descriptor)
       {
           if (_reservedInterfaces.Contains(descriptor.ServiceType))
               return ValidationResult.Fail(
                   $"Cannot register reserved interface {descriptor.ServiceType}");
           if (IsLifetimeMismatch(descriptor))
               return ValidationResult.Fail("Lifetime mismatch detected");
           return ValidationResult.Success();
       }
   }
   ```

3. **Create Extension Registration API**:
   ```csharp
   public interface IExtensionServiceRegistration
   {
       void ConfigureServices(IExtensionServiceCollection services);
   }
   ```

